  text: 'nice way to build an interactive mascot ↓


    - gen character expression sheet

    - gen video of them looking 360

    - use llm to extract frames

    - create sprite

    - hook up to pointer (js + css)


    this let''s you raise fidelity 🤙

    sometimes 9 frames isn''t enough


